Stormy + Longbow is fine, or even just the longbow.  Other than when
levitating, you won't need melee much.  Arrows/daggers are limited
just like everything else (3 gives you the maximum expected value of
getting 1.8 in return).

> Other things I've heard are good to wish for:
> -magic marker

These are very valuable.

If you want "oLS (pretty valuable), go with MKoT, "oLS, ]oReflection.
If not, go with MKoT, BoH.

In either case, the remaining 2-3 (or 1-2 in the first case) wishes
I'd spend on magic markers.

> -scrolls of genocide
> -blessed tinning kit
> -wand of polymorph
> -ring of levitation
> -archon figurine

Ehh.  =Lev if you don't have a better source by the Castle (though
maybe even then save the wish until you're about to enter the planes).

> Also, how many wishes should I keep in reserve for emergencies?

